==English==

===Etymology===
{{etyl|la|en}} {{term|circum||[[about]]}} + {{term|venire||to [[come]]}}

===Pronunciation===
* {{rhymes|ɛnt|lang=en}}

===Verb===
{{en-verb}}

# {{context|transitive|lang=en}} to [[avoid]] or get around something; to [[bypass]]
# {{context|transitive|lang=en}} to [[surround]] or [[besiege]]
# {{context|transitive|lang=en}} to [[outwit]] or [[outsmart]]

